designer_notes = "PLACEHOLDER (PROGRESS 110, 2026-11-18, Luke: \"map everything to placeholder abilities and I'll try them in action\"): a motion lab move (game/regents/motion/) on a placeholder built from existing atoms, to try as a prototype. Its name, numbers and what it really does are Luke's. Axe, an E option: the axe swept out, its head turned to hook, and yanked back with what it caught, hauled in to 1.2 m (hook_pull.tres, dragged.tres; Luke, 2026-11-18: with the axe itself, closer in)."
